{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1480737-fishing","id":1480737,"title":"Fishing?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-05-11T03:32:18-07:00","id":1480737,"title":"Fishing?","content":"What ability would fishing fall under?<br /> <br /> Sail sounds relevant because sea stuff - but... it has nothing to do with using a fishing rod.<br /> <br /> and for all the perfects that a solaroid might have, then I want one to have The Perfect Cast <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BpxzF7MwaU8\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BpxzF7MwaU8</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malfeas F'Tagn - go check out my epic MLP/Exalted crossover &quot;The Scroll of Exalted ponies&quot; @ Fimfiction","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/588-webkilla","name":"webkilla","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar588_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-14T11:19:35-07:00","id":1505341,"title":"","content":"Isn't it Survival?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"left\"><span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">She/Her. I am literal-minded and write literally. If I don't say something explicitly, please never assume I implied it. The only exception is if I try to make a joke.</span></span></span></div> <span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">My point of view may be different from yours but is equally valid.</span></span></span><br /> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1x1ycoxJF0G9niMt5D3Pp7owZ7tw8AJvL?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted-cWoD-ArM url mega-library</a>. Exalted <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/663334-random-name-generator\" target=\"_blank\">name-generators</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/896-erinys","name":"Erinys","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar896_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4235"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-14T15:59:45-07:00","id":1505382,"title":"","content":"Survival is definitely the default &quot;catch animals to eat&quot; trait in the books. But that's not really going to get as epic as you can if you go to, say, One Piece and some of the fishing Luffy and his crew get up to.<br /> <br /> So yeah, Survival if you just want to be perfect at catching normal fish and all that.<br /> <br /> But if you want to go fishing for megafauna and behemoths instead, you could get into naval combat or standard combats with Melee (rods) or Thrown (nets) weapons with the Grapple tag and have the process of reeling in a true giant fish take a whole slew of Abilities to pull off.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-15T07:20:04-07:00","id":1508442,"title":"","content":"Solar Charms are sometimes about a &quot;persona&quot; who would be awesome at that Ability, more than the function of the Ability itself. Could definitely see a fishing effect in Sail too.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/456-blackwell","name":"Blackwell","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar456_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"977"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-15T12:56:56-07:00","id":1508478,"title":"","content":"The main (practical) thing to look at when adding a &quot;new&quot; functionality to an Ability, IMO, is &quot;which set of Charms supports the actual actions the player will want to take?&quot;<br /> <br /> It's useless, for example, to file an action under Melee--even if it &quot;fits&quot; logically--if none of the Melee Charmset actually supports doing that action; the player will have to build all new Charms anyway. To that end, I'd ask &quot;What does the player actually want to accomplish with fishing?&quot; If it's just &quot;feed people, maybe encounter a Big Fish once in a while,&quot; that's a single Charm under Survival already, so just let it be Survival. If they want something more involved, like a tactical battle between their character and various fish, then Sail's system and Charms (such as they are) provide more to hook on to.<br /> <br /> (Asking this question also tends to short-circuit a lot of purely hypothetical questions on &quot;which Ability does what?&quot;)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/396-mr-rage","name":"Mr Rage","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"14"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-17T08:11:09-07:00","id":1508636,"title":"","content":"I think you could find a cool fishing/hunting Charm in Survival, <b>River Monster Expedition</b>, riffing off of &quot;Introduce a Fact&quot; to declare that there is a local-legend &quot;Big One&quot; nearby that you can then hunt for social bonuses. Maybe permanent Contacts or something?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":456,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/456-blackwell","user":"Blackwell","date":". 04-17-2023, 10:27 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/456-blackwell","name":"Blackwell","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar456_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"977"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-17T19:00:39-07:00","id":1508702,"title":"","content":"I still find it funny that an E1 Survival 1 Solar Charm (Food-Gathering Exercise in 3e) explicitly lets you <b>contest the ST</b> when it comes to catching a fish. <br /> <br /> &quot;You are standing on the edge of the Maw of Oblivion, your limbs wrenched from their sockets and your eyes burning with the molten glass of Orabilis. What do you do?&quot;<br /> &quot;I catch a large fish&quot;<br /> &quot;There's nothing alive down there. The raw entropy annihilates your hook and line-&quot;<br /> &quot;I. Catch. A large fish&quot;<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26460-organ-boy","name":"Organ Boy","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"63"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-17T19:11:28-07:00","id":1508704,"title":"","content":"Voidcarp. Fine dining indeed.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Monkish Asexual.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1490057-cauthon-s-homebrew-hub#post1490057\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a><br /> <br /> Mostly checked out, there's an uncomfortable amount of condescension in the old guard.</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","name":"Cauthon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27258_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1780"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-17T23:26:32-07:00","id":1508712,"title":"","content":"The Book of Wonders Wanted has some really awesome fishing Charms under Survival, including one that lets you look at a body of water and introduce facts about what might live there, and also introduce facts about the kind of bait you could use to catch those things! Very fun concept, immediately made me want to play a Solar fisherman.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11619-kymmetheseventh","name":"KymmetheSeventh","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11619_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"151"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-18T22:05:54-07:00","id":1508835,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>KymmetheSeventh</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1480737-fishing?p=1508712#post1508712\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__d